---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | {{name}}"
  description="How {{name}} collects, uses and protects personal information when you use our locksmith services in {{location}}."
>
  <section class="max-w-prose2 mx-auto px-5 py-16">
    <p class="kicker mb-3">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="space-y-6 text-stone2 leading-relaxed">
      <p>This notice explains how <strong class="text-ink">{{name}}</strong> handles personal data when you use this website or request locksmith services in {{location}}.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink pt-4">What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you call or contact us we may record your name, phone number, the property address where work is needed, and details of the job. We collect only what we need to attend promptly, confirm you're entitled to request the work, complete the job safely, and meet our legal obligations.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink pt-4">Identity checks</h2>
      <p>For entry work (lockouts, safe opening) we're required to confirm you have the right to access the property or item. We may ask for photo ID and proof of address or ownership. These checks protect you and are a condition of carrying out the work.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink pt-4">How long we keep information</h2>
      <p>Job records are kept for as long as needed for guarantees, insurance and accounting purposes, then deleted. We do not sell or share your details for marketing.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink pt-4">Your rights</h2>
      <p>Under UK GDPR you may request a copy of the information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it where we have no continuing obligation to retain it. Call the number on this site to make a request.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink pt-4">Cookies</h2>
      <p>See our <a href="/cookie/" class="text-brass-deep underline">Cookie Policy</a> for details of the limited cookies used on this site.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
